// Pins the strict-error decision for view::directed: a direction parallel
// to the up vector leaves no plane to build the camera basis from, so the
// call errors instead of applying a fallback. The vectors differ in
// magnitude and sign; parallelism is checked on the normalized vectors.
@settings(experimentalFeatures = allow)

bad = view::directed([0, 0, 5], up = [0, 0, -1])
